                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a89c6877-9528-33d0-831a-03febf606abf",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7c99d2-8695-30b4-9776-865e1e7677d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not drunk; not intoxicated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f0aa6f1-44a1-36f8-91a4-3a77624a208f",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7c99d2-8695-30b4-9776-865e1e7677d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not under the influence of any recreational drug."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a1da09a-ef50-4d86-a5eb-5145420a6150",
                                                "sense_id": "4f0aa6f1-44a1-36f8-91a4-3a77624a208f",
                                                "text": "Ten months sober, I must admit\nJust because you're clean, don't mean you don't miss it"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a91027b-d956-3c39-b1eb-fc29b232a44f",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7c99d2-8695-30b4-9776-865e1e7677d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not given to excessive drinking of alcohol."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ae7d021-9072-4718-871b-5156edd41469",
                                                "sense_id": "4a91027b-d956-3c39-b1eb-fc29b232a44f",
                                                "text": "Amid all the confusion and disorder that sin has introduced into the world, the Christian in union with God has a grace or Divine help that enables him to live the sober, self-restrained life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edd9c60d-bedd-4f37-9d43-dedd1cf4ef18",
                                                "sense_id": "4a91027b-d956-3c39-b1eb-fc29b232a44f",
                                                "text": "After eliminating alcohol from their lives, some sober individuals exclusively date nondrinkers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7544796-0646-4747-a640-fd24b77272b8",
                                                "sense_id": "4a91027b-d956-3c39-b1eb-fc29b232a44f",
                                                "text": "Rose told me that she's sober."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90a08e4b-7218-3c6b-9232-b58073d86c3d",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7c99d2-8695-30b4-9776-865e1e7677d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moderate; realistic; serious; not playful; not passionate; cool; self-controlled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71ba99d4-dd9a-4be0-b9b8-09c2753e5f29",
                                                "sense_id": "90a08e4b-7218-3c6b-9232-b58073d86c3d",
                                                "text": "God help me to watch and to be sober."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "496a0bec-cc87-4e70-b559-f85d7632a8b2",
                                                "sense_id": "90a08e4b-7218-3c6b-9232-b58073d86c3d",
                                                "text": "[N]o ſober man vvould put himſelf into a danger for the Applauſe of ſcaping vvithout breaking his Neck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41ee00ac-9e18-474d-8a9b-4252ce8ba715",
                                                "sense_id": "90a08e4b-7218-3c6b-9232-b58073d86c3d",
                                                "text": "Which is the finest and soberest state possible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1acf81fc-256c-358c-bd25-41506d15e335",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7c99d2-8695-30b4-9776-865e1e7677d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dull; not bright or colorful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of color"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7978e648-7b27-4908-bb6c-6f4bd6f5de48",
                                                "sense_id": "1acf81fc-256c-358c-bd25-41506d15e335",
                                                "text": "Twilight grey / Had in her sober livery all things clad."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5cf6fe41-04d7-3784-a772-722828005638",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7c99d2-8695-30b4-9776-865e1e7677d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Subdued; solemn; grave."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9baba04d-a7e4-4c4f-8d6c-7b4e94cbb91a",
                                                "sense_id": "5cf6fe41-04d7-3784-a772-722828005638",
                                                "text": "See her sober over a sampler, or gay over a jointed baby."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a33f1988-83a3-4527-a3da-f01216884abe",
                                                "sense_id": "5cf6fe41-04d7-3784-a772-722828005638",
                                                "text": "What parts gay France from sober Spain? A little rising rocky chain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fab10e7-2bce-329b-847b-d1d405402021",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7c99d2-8695-30b4-9776-865e1e7677d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Poor; feeble."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sober",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54167c4d-e815-30bb-8f4c-0e9149aede80",
                                        "entry_id": "eca56b39-cfa9-32ce-8fc6-4e7672744a97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make or become sober."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often",
                                            "with-up"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c52cae46-415f-4987-a7ab-eec39bfefccf",
                                                "sense_id": "54167c4d-e815-30bb-8f4c-0e9149aede80",
                                                "text": "There shallow draughts intoxicate the brain, / And drinking largely sobers us again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93a76e41-ae9c-43ea-87f7-6e7d77175e85",
                                                "sense_id": "54167c4d-e815-30bb-8f4c-0e9149aede80",
                                                "text": "The night air may have sobered him a bit by the time they got back to Beattock."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a12d1259-3d47-36f5-88b0-11e1845c98f7",
                                        "entry_id": "eca56b39-cfa9-32ce-8fc6-4e7672744a97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To overcome or lose a state of intoxication."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often",
                                            "with-up"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ba949e2-4578-4977-a45a-976b488aa170",
                                                "sense_id": "a12d1259-3d47-36f5-88b0-11e1845c98f7",
                                                "text": "It took him hours to sober up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d939124c-67e0-35d2-b416-eae428f40954",
                                        "entry_id": "eca56b39-cfa9-32ce-8fc6-4e7672744a97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To moderate one's feelings; to accept a disappointing reality after losing one's ability to believe in a fantastic goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b760210-f531-4557-9291-e492059d7f96",
                                                "sense_id": "d939124c-67e0-35d2-b416-eae428f40954",
                                                "text": "Losing his job was a sobering experience."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e6d1fbd3-8b0b-4d5d-bd15-01f0c2ac5cb8",
